{"id":"erunda","lemma":"ерунда","pos":"noun","rank":1146,"glosses":["nonsense, rubbish","trifle"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6c/Ru-%D0%B5%D1%80%D1%83%D0%BD%D0%B4%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D0%B5%D1%80%D1%83%D0%BD%D0%B4%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"ерунды"},"examples":[{"text":"Это всё ерунда.","en":"It's all nonsense.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"everything, all"},null]},{"text":"Не говори ерунды.","en":"Don't talk rubbish.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"},null]},{"text":"По-моему, это ерунда.","en":"I think it's nonsense.","words":[{"g":"along / by"},{"g":"my, mine","l":"мой"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"То, что ты сказала, - полная ерунда!","en":"What you said is absolute nonsense.","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"},{"g":"full, complete","l":"полный"},null]},{"text":"Не говорите ерунды.","en":"Don't talk nonsense!","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"},null]}]}